    "description": "Vintage Glass Insulator Lot with Mounting Bracket\nBrand\n: Whitall Tatum\nModel\n: No.2\nColor\n: Clear\nDepartment\n: Antiques\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nCondition\n: Fair: Noticeable visible imperfections\nDescription\n: Discover a fascinating piece of industrial history with this vintage lot of glass telephone/telegraph insulators, including a sturdy metal mounting bracket. These unique collectibles feature classic clear glass insulators from the renowned Whitall Tatum No.2 series, as well as Hemingray models, all in used vintage condition. Each insulator displays distinct character, with embossed branding and minor surface wear that adds to their authentic charm. The included metal mounting bracket makes it easy to display these as a conversation-worthy centerpiece in any industrial-inspired decor, or to start a collection. Glass insulators make striking paperweights, shelf art, or functional accents for creative reuse. Trust in the enduring craftsmanship and authenticity of original U.S. utility artifactsperfect for collectors, decorators, or vintage enthusiasts seeking genuine historical items. All items shown in photos are included, making this a versatile and decorative set.\nUSED ITEMS DISCLAIMER:\nPlease note that all items have been donated. All items are used and untested (including battery life & functionality), lots are unsorted, unless otherwise noted. We do our best to ensure the quality of all our auctions & describe them accurately; however, we are not experts in any field. Items may contain unseen flaws or unknown missing parts not noted in the description.\nAll items are sold AS IS.\nIf you need further information about an item, please contact us prior to the close of the auction.\nTERMS OF SALE:\nOrders must be paid for within seven (7) days from the close of auction. All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be relisted for auction without further notice. Displays used to stage product are not included in purchase. Auctions cannot be combined if listed as such under Shipping tab.\nAUTHENTICATION:\nWe do not authenticate or appraise auction items, unless otherwise indicated in auction description or photographs.",
